WEBVTT

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.660
Welcome home, Brother!

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:48.630
I always followed after him...

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:50.810
But...

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:00.950
But...

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:05.080
Last Waltz

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:20.070
Lavinia!

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:23.980
Get off, you stupid things!

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:25.520
Ermy!

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:27.540
--Martha!
--Don't move!

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:32.130
Martha!

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:33.430
I'm fine!

00:01:33.430 --> 00:01:34.890
Martha! Ermy!

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:38.700
I'll handle this! You two return
to ship while you can still move!

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:40.200
Hurry!

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.570
--Roger!
--Roger!

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:54.080
Alright! That does it for all
the TUMORs around here!

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.450
Let's move to the next area!

00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:56.780
--Roger!
--Roger!

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:00.690
She's...

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:02.590
Mariette! Let's hurry!

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:03.780
Yeah!

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:09.160
TUMORs in Compartment W-51
have been neutralized!

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:12.800
Gambee squad has engaged
the enemy in Block E4!

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:15.670
54% of the enemy TUMORs
have been destroyed!

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:16.840
We can drive them back!

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:17.840
Stay sharp, now!

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:21.570
Headmaster Craven! A message
from Strain 01, Lottie Gelh!

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:23.010
What?!

00:02:23.010 --> 00:02:25.040
Put it on the main screen!

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:28.450
Libertad! Do you read?!
This is Strain 01!

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:32.250
Instructors Dufarge and Melchi recovered!
Now returning to ship!

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.490
It's already cramped in here! Quit moving!

00:02:34.490 --> 00:02:36.220
You're all right?!

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:36.860
Yes.

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:39.760
Where's Gutsy Girl?!
Where's Sara now?!

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:44.290
Strain EX is currently locked
in combat with Ralph Werec's Gloire!

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:50.600
Why don't you understand?!

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:56.880
You know what we...
what humans did to them!

00:02:56.880 --> 00:03:03.150
All humans must die to atone
for what they've done!

00:03:03.150 --> 00:03:04.780
No!

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:08.790
Simply spreading death everywhere
won't atone for anything!

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:10.890
That's just what you want to do!

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:15.700
You're only murdering people
so that you can be at peace!

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:17.130
Give them back!

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:21.270
Mary! Colin! Cedie! Carris!

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:23.740
You killed them all, Brother!

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:26.830
Be quiet!

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:40.650
Mercurion?!

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:42.850
The control assembly won't activate!

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:48.230
Brother...

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:50.030
Sara!

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:52.300
We're heading back to the Libertad for now!

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:54.430
L-let go! I still haven't-

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:57.930
Don't be crazy! Do you think
you can fight like that?!

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.830
Sara...

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:32.710
Send only those who need
surgery to the infirmary!

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:34.240
Send the lesser-injured to the mess hall!

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:37.580
Fire in Block E! All available hands,
hurry and put it out!

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.580
We don't have enough
Type-A transfusion packs!

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:42.340
--Should I round up some donors?!
--Do it!

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:50.220
This is the first time I've come here...

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:57.660
We'll have it fixed in a jiffy!
Bring Emily down with you!

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.000
Okay.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:02.970
Use parts from Dickon's unit to do
emergency repairs on Sara's!

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:07.170
Hurry! There's no telling when
Ralph will next attack!

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:10.840
Ermy! Martha!
Transfer the Mercurion from your units!

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:12.280
Right!

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:14.270
Let's swap out the cracked screens!

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.770
Sara-san!

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:40.870
Becky... Dickon...

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:43.030
We'll take her for you.

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:46.610
We need to circulate her Mercurion.

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:47.700
Yes...

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:51.820
Yeah...

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:53.480
Sara...

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:57.880
Thanks for earlier...

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:02.460
Use my Strain's parts.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.060
Sara!

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:06.330
Leave the Mercurion to us!

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:09.300
We'll make sure ya got every last drop!

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:12.940
--Hey, you! Quit your slacking!
--Yes, sir...

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:14.410
Sara.

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:17.900
Fight for us, too. And...

00:06:19.110 --> 00:06:21.310
...avenge Carris...

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:28.490
Lottie?

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:29.690
Oh! Sara!

00:06:29.690 --> 00:06:31.160
What's going on?

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:34.530
Sorry about earlier.
Was I a little too pushy?

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:38.330
No. I think that was probably
the best choice in that situation.

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:39.830
Oh.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:44.240
Anyways! Rest a little, be ready
for battle, and expect anything!

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:47.100
That's the job of a Reasoner!

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:53.910
I made them in a hurry, so they
don't look good, but they taste good!

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:57.750
I think. No... they can't be bad!
Don't worry about how they look!

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:58.850
Can I eat some?

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:00.150
Yeah!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:07.460
Yummy!

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:09.660
See! I told you! Eat up!

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:10.990
Thank you.

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:20.130
Oh? It's tear-jerkingly delicious?!

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:24.400
Yummy!

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:57.180
A lot's happened...

00:07:57.180 --> 00:07:58.510
Yeah...

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:06.850
Doesn't sound like your
determination is going to weaken...

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:14.350
No. Because I have nothing left now...

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:20.200
Do you remember our competition that day?

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:21.200
Competition?

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:25.740
Yeah. The gravity
training simulator incident.

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:26.870
Ah...

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:29.710
You were the first person to ever
put up such a fight against me!

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:32.510
Though you proved to be no match for me.

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:35.380
Just a minute! Who was no match for you?!

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:38.280
You! You weren't!
You lost to me!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:41.720
--No, I didn't! I obviously won!
--I clearly won!

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:48.160
That was clearly my win!

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:51.330
I'll admit you fought bravely,
but I'm not giving you my victory!

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:52.990
--Look here!
--What?!

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:04.280
When this is all over,
let's finish what we started that day.

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:07.550
--Eh?
--I'm offering you a rematch!

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:10.580
I already told you, I won that match!

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:11.980
Just keep telling yourself that!

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:15.920
Fine! This time I'll set
the record straight for good!

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:20.790
In that case... stay alive,
even if it means death!

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:23.280
Got that, Gutsy Girl?!

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:30.230
Yes... Queen.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.440
Sara.

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:40.710
Sorry for the wait!

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:45.620
We could've done better if the Libertad
wasn't in this condition...

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:47.490
But it's pretty good, right?

00:09:47.490 --> 00:09:49.520
Thank you, Carmichael.

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:53.050
I'm appalled you would
do this to my Strain!

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:57.260
Bring it back in good shape next time!

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:58.730
Just the Strain?

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:01.530
Shut up, Carmichael!

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:05.170
You stay safe too, of course!

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:08.470
After all, both you and it belong to me!

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:11.740
Yes...

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:15.380
Sara...

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:21.540
Thank you, Emily.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:25.660
Emily?

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:28.320
I'm coming with you, too!

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:32.420
--It'll be dangerous.
--No! I'm coming with you, too!

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:35.430
Emily...

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:37.240
Please!

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:41.900
I... don't want to be alone anymore!

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:58.320
Okay...

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:01.660
Let's go together.

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:03.630
Yeah!

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:06.700
We've confirmed the Gloire Type's location.

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:08.500
Thanks to everyone's hard work,

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:11.040
we've successfully wiped out the TUMORs.

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:15.640
The Libertad no longer has
the offensive capabilities

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:17.970
to ward off a Gloire Type.

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:26.720
Sara. Our only hope for survival
is in your hands now...

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:28.410
Godspeed.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.720
Open catapult deck!

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:59.310
Strain EX, Sara Werec! Heading out!

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:23.640
Brother...

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:39.660
Sara!

00:12:57.580 --> 00:12:58.910
Brother!

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:02.180
Brother! Please, no more!

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:03.880
Emily?

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:06.090
Emily! Come!

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:06.990
Emily!

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:08.490
No!

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:09.820
I...

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:14.360
I want to stay with Sara!

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:48.190
Brother!

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:51.630
Only you can accomplish
what you've decided.

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:55.860
As long as you believe in that,
there's surely nothing you can't do!

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:07.950
Brother. I'm going to accomplish
what I've decided to do.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:13.040
I'm... not going to let you
kill anyone else!

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:17.380
Sara!

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:20.560
Don't tell me she's-

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:28.070
She's going into sub-light speed...

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:30.900
...to keep us from getting
caught in the battle!

00:14:39.780 --> 00:14:46.450
This means she... Sara Werec...
will be this term's first graduate...

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:48.020
Yes...

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:51.690
Go finish things up, Sara...

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:54.490
And then we can have a do-over...

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.100
It's okay.

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:04.440
You're not alone.

00:15:04.440 --> 00:15:05.460
Yeah...

00:16:12.870 --> 00:16:14.900
Welcome home, Brother!

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:06.550
Sara...

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:09.790
Sara...

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:12.650
Sara...

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:15.330
Sa-

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.170
Sara...

00:17:20.170 --> 00:17:22.240
Brother?!

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:27.910
Take care... of Emily... Sara...

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:29.240
Brother!

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:38.610
You've... improved...
